Package: solvency2
Type: Package
Title: Offline Solvency II Calculations and Regulatory Parameters
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"),
    email = "riskdatascience@web.de")
Description: Native, offline calculations for Solvency II with explicit rule
    profiles, regulatory parameters, correlation matrices and synthetic reference
    cases. Structured results record inputs, sources and analyst overrides.
    The implementation follows the published 'solvency2' Python reference
    library without requiring Python at runtime. Includes local curve adapters,
    dependency graphs and archived reporting definitions and component checks.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, digest, gmp, Rmpfr, xml2
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/rds0001/solvency2-r
BugReports: https://github.com/rds0001/solvency2-r/issues
